# "Target creature you control": Bot2's Ornithopter is a creature but not Bot1's, so Octopus Form cannot be cast on it (the refusal); the same
# spell on Bot1's own Ornithopter is offered (the positive control) and resolves, making it a 1/3. Octopus Form is also an instant: it is cast
# on Bot2's turn. The pump ends at end of turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Island
Ornithopter
Octopus Form
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Hand.Octopus Form.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Octopus Form.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 1
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Octopus Form
